<title>POLAND: Kompap up 12.4 pct in bourse debut.</title>
<headline>Kompap up 12.4 pct in bourse debut.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish paper firm Kompap SA started trading on the parallel floor of the Warsaw Stock Exchange at 28.1 zlotys, 12.4 percent above its public offer price of 25 zlotys.</p>
<p>In August investors subscribed for nearly four times the 340,000 shares in the firm's initial public offering.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
